      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Let's hope VRC listens to this.\nWith the extreme limit for Quest, why have physbones anyway? You can barely use them. Most avatars won't work. Quest avatars are perf blocked after a certain rank anyway... cant you just let individual quest users decide whether they want to show the physbones on someone's avatar or not?? I don't see the point in having such a demanding limit.",
