  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Physbones ran completely fine for me without a hard limit, I'm fact, putting that hard limit makes it harder for quest users to see the \"good\" in the Physbones. In mine and a lot of my quest friends experience there's no lag, or frame drops in 1185-1188 when showing peoplse avatars with 100+ Physbones. If you want a limit, please make the max a more reasonable amount because right now it's not helping anyone and is causing more draw backs then needed. Either have the limit how it was in 1188 or just increase the Physbone limit\nIf they wanted a limit, it should've already been there.",
